sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant L as Login.asmx
  participant P as PasswordHelper
  participant DB as MySQL SP layer
  C->>L: LoginUser(username, password)
  L->>DB: sp_Get_EmployeeForLogin
  Note over DB: DEFINITION NOT IN REPO
  DB-->>L: PasswordHash EmployeeId FullName RoleName
  L->>P: Verify bcrypt
  P-->>L: ok/fail
  L->>DB: sp_Insert_AuditLog
  L-->>C: JWT+CSRF cookies + JSON profile
